{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590470/extras/RoboCatcher_ZERO_Pincipale.png?t=1744662677\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Robo Catcher Zero is a demo of Robo Catcher! This is its free version!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Search and find the holo-robo thanks to Finder's wifi antenna, in a evolutive map drawn entirely by hand!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590470/extras/radar.gif?t=1744662677\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scan &amp; build new Robo using &quot;bugZZ&quot;!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590470/extras/scan_and_build.gif?t=1744662677\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pick your &quot;Top 3&quot; and create your &quot;Team&quot; so you can hang out with them during your journey!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590470/extras/team_RC.gif?t=1744662677\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>32 robo to find and collect, designed by comic book authors Valentin Seiche and Mortis Ghost (also creator of the game OFF), Pixel-Boy and AAA.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590470/extras/Inventaire_robo_petit.jpg?t=1744662677\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A chill and cute ballad game, for the pleasure of discovering the nooks and crannies of a district that evolves over the course of the game and expanding your Robo collection!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3590470?t=1744662677","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590470/3dd72b5d442bffa69e89d3322afaf8def2d54716/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744662677","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590470/306358f888661065b122dfcee12245c83b8ccb88/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744662677","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590470/306358f888661065b122dfcee12245c83b8ccb88/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744662677","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590470/extras/RoboCatcher_ZERO_Pincipale.png?t=1744662677\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Robo Catcher Zero is a demo of Robo Catcher! This is its free version!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Search and find the holo-robo thanks to Finder's wifi antenna, in a evolutive map drawn entirely by hand!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590470/extras/radar.gif?t=1744662677\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scan &amp; build new Robo using &quot;bugZZ&quot;!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590470/extras/scan_and_build.gif?t=1744662677\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pick your &quot;Top 3&quot; and create your &quot;Team&quot; so you can hang out with them during your journey!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590470/extras/team_RC.gif?t=1744662677\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>32 robo to find and collect, designed by comic book authors Valentin Seiche and Mortis Ghost (also creator of the game OFF), Pixel-Boy and AAA.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590470/extras/Inventaire_robo_petit.jpg?t=1744662677\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A chill and cute ballad game, for the pleasure of discovering the nooks and crannies of a district that evolves over the course of the game and expanding your Robo collection!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Pixel_Fortress"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3589460","name":"Robo Catcher"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590470/58cc0a4c8a66874a00f5e481ef1e44f67b0a531a/header.jpg?t=1744662677","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"2025 \u00a9 Pixel Fortress SAS","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Robo Catcher Zero (Demo)","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\